# oracle: min_style sd (line quadratic) on a 2d binary lj system with enforce2d and min_modify dmax 0.05: per-iteration energies (20 iterations: native and the engine part at iteration 21, cause not identified)
# oracle-inputs: w47ls_2d.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
dimension       2
read_data       w47ls_2d.data
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0
pair_coeff      2 2 0.5 0.88
pair_coeff      1 2 1.5 0.8
neighbor        0.3 bin
fix             2d all enforce2d
thermo_style    custom step pe fnorm press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          1
min_style       sd
min_modify      dmax 0.05
minimize        0 0 20 1000
